      "provenance": "WolvenKit AreaShapeOutline.CustomRead/CustomWrite read/write only Buffer; its constructor leaves Points as the four-point unit square and Height as 2. Native area_shape_outline_buffer writes only the decoded buffer and codec reads only that buffer. The packed count + count*Vector4 + height is authoritative. Convenience geometry must match packed float32 values or the exact constructor defaults; changed buffers, malformed buffers, and contradictory geometry fail. Source hashes invalidate this narrowly scoped rule.",
